txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=80c68bf280049a9f53454b2942a7af7f", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/b3719259/uploads/origins/da585fe9-079c-4dc9-810c-c90ef1eac265?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=80c68bf280049a9f53454b2942a7af7f, https://si.imgix.net/b3719259/uploads/origins/da585fe9-079c-4dc9-810c-c90ef1eac265?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=b34e4e07d69f3df474ecbb9edf49cf5d 2x, https://si.imgix.net/b3719259/uploads/origins/da585fe9-079c-4dc9-810c-c90ef1eac265?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=f11478410ad86c5113cbfb778f67607c 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@831too/works/174", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/1e1e6ffc/uploads/origins/c6e186b9-02c3-48e0-bf5f-abd1ad2c701e?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=348e41c8cb19b24f2f8a46e2b9197dd3", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/1e1e6ffc/uploads/origins/c6e186b9-02c3-48e0-bf5f-abd1ad2c701e?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=348e41c8cb19b24f2f8a46e2b9197dd3, https://si.imgix.net/1e1e6ffc/uploads/origins/c6e186b9-02c3-48e0-bf5f-abd1ad2c701e?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=e4bfac5d32704ad39e12e1eb7ee16f6f 2x, https://si.imgix.net/1e1e6ffc/uploads/origins/c6e186b9-02c3-48e0-bf5f-abd1ad2c701e?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=9a80f46e9b4f7d373d88d77df5104b64 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "こんにちは！もう一枚イラストを注文してもいいでしょうか？私のシッピーと一緒にあなたの作品を本当に愛しています！<3\n\n今回はハロウィンをテーマにしたイラストをお願いします！\nカボチャやキャンディー、不気味でかわいいハロウィンの要素がとても好きなので、可能であれば使ってください！\n\nドリーミーはよくシリウスをからかう。ドリーミーがシリウスをからかうことが多いので、シリウスはドリーミーによくからかわれる。\n\n夢のような衣装：\nhttps://www.deviantart.com/stash/01ekmworxhin\n彼女のデザインは単純化しても構わない！\n\n恋心のコスチューム：\nhttps://www.deviantart.com/stash/01vu391xhdud\nhttps://www.deviantart.com/stash/01wbqf11zxhi\n\n一緒に\nhttps://dresirigallery.carrd.co/#witchsheart", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@831too/works/173", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/9bb3611d/uploads/origins/be239dfd-0fd5-4f5c-bcac-25bf9807bee1?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=8311b42f7ae845fb4336ab1bb16d6686", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/9bb3611d/uploads/origins/be239dfd-0fd5-4f5c-bcac-25bf9807bee1?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=8311b42f7ae845fb4336ab1bb16d6686, https://si.imgix.net/9bb3611d/uploads/origins/be239dfd-0fd5-4f5c-bcac-25bf9807bee1?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=785b213b99ec4b9becfcac3ef0e5c3c7 2x, https://si.imgix.net/9bb3611d/uploads/origins/be239dfd-0fd5-4f5c-bcac-25bf9807bee1?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=17a7b5151ad83fbdbb7050ef9dcbcb2e 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "The scenario is a world where supernatural creatures come from a \"Blue Fog\". Both characters work for the same company that exterminates monsters.\n\n\n📂 SUMIN | 178CM | 38 YEARS OLD\n\nA high-ranking officer. He carries the burden of many deceased comrades, including his twin sister. He believes it was his fault she died. He does not want to live, but understands he is wasting her sacrifice if he dies. Instead, he spends his days somewhat aimlessly, trying to find anything that is \"entertaining\" or \"interesting\" while trying to accomplish his personal goals.\n\nHe is fox-like and charming, naturally attracting people to his outward personality. He is very fickle, but shrewd at the same time, viewing other people as either beneficial or detrimental to his personal goals. He has no issue with leaving or abandoning others. He is a lonely person, but has convinced himself that it is an inevitability of life.\n\nMOTIFS: Night ocean. Abandoned temples. Summer evenings. Sparklers.\n\n※ Please remember his earrings. Please cover his neck. It is okay to cut off his ponytail if you enjoy drawing short hair. \n\n❓ SYCAMORE | 188CM | 38 YEARS OLD\n\nA doctor by trade, with keen intellect and a knack for medicine. He can seem silly and overly lighthearted at times, but he means well.\n\nCalm and serene. He seems to have a smile on his face at all times. He exudes a gentle aura, and though he can act childish as a joke, people typically regard him as a kind person. In truth, although he pretends to be warm-hearted without any ulterior motives, he is actually quite the apathetic person who has endured many losses of loved ones and a lot of grief in his past. He pretends to be friendly and kind because he does not think he deserves to grieve.\n\nMOTIFS: Gingko leaves. Autumn days. Operating room table. Shattered glass.\n\n※ Please note the two (2) moles Sycamore has under both of his eyes, and the scar over his right eye. He is frequently covered in scars, bruises, and bandages, and is always wearing gloves.\n\n\n📂❓ RELATIONSHIP: They have an unconventional relationship that is very toxic and push-and-pull. In front of their colleagues, they look like a playful duo that enjoy teasing and flirting with each other. In actuality, they are constantly pushing each other's boundaries in a twisted game to see who \"breaks down\" first. There's no purpose to this game; both of them are simply bored with the lives they are forced to live and they are \"fun\" challenges to each other. \n\nSumin and Sycamore have many deeper similarities that neither of them are willing to fully disclose. It is in front of Sumin that Sycamore feels most comfortable dropping his \"kind-hearted mask.\" Sumin does not want Sycamore to get any closer and continues to act in ways he believes will get Sycamore to leave him alone. They know enough about each other that they know how to say cruel things to each other, and they are both so reckless that neither of them truly have boundaries with each other.\n\nSumin and Sycamore are always smiling. Sometimes, these smiles are playful. Sometimes, these smiles are wicked.\n\n📂 --> ❓: You do not matter to me, so you cannot be my burden.\n\n❓ --> 📂: The less I matter to you, the more I want to burden you.\n\n\nThe pose and composition are entirely up to you. Please feel free to turn down this request for any reason. Thank you for your consideration!\n\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/u/3/folders/1RmyRSztQHsGaoUawS_aALd2_ZUKxhXh8", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@831too/works/172", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/59b62718/uploads/origins/6a7b602e-7847-4eb2-911f-01fabf4ef59c?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=f77c31b618177b0d016be60e6f26b115", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/59b62718/uploads/origins/6a7b602e-7847-4eb2-911f-01fabf4ef59c?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=f77c31b618177b0d016be60e6f26b115, https://si.imgix.net/59b62718/uploads/origins/6a7b602e-7847-4eb2-911f-01fabf4ef59c?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=d7318dd17a81dd64e9b454ff9e793776 2x, https://si.imgix.net/59b62718/uploads/origins/6a7b602e-7847-4eb2-911f-01fabf4ef59c?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=038ee2a32b6b214b3feb68b01ffedac4 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "831様　初めまして。\nご縁がありましたら韓国人OC 2人組のリクエストをお願いしたくお送りします！警察学校時代からの同僚・親友の警察官二人組です。前世は軍人で髪が長く、現代では二人とも短くなっています。服や髪、シチュエーションは自由にアレンジいただいて大丈夫です。頂いた作品は個人利用（壁紙、非商用印刷物（グッズ））と、Skeb依頼用参考資料にて使用します。\n\n■ジオ(黒髪)　男性/180cm/25歳\n警察音楽隊に所属。トロンボーン奏者。左目の下にホクロ(向かって右)あり。\n自信家で心が広く情にアツい。友人も多くダジャレ好きでよく滑る。\n早朝、ハユンを誘って外の自然公園で演奏することが日課。ハユンに対し大型犬のような振る舞いが多い。\n\n■ハユン(赤髪)　男性/180cm/25歳\nジオと所属は違うが警察官。趣味がフルート。\n名家の出自で生真面目で規律を重視する。他人にも自分にも厳しいがオンオフが激しく、オフではよく笑い人の世話を焼き、情に弱い面も。前世が軍人でジオと戦場にいた記憶を持つ。ジオに執着を持っており片思い中で、女王様気質を見せる。\n\nご検討頂けますと幸いです…！\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/u/1/folders/1iImFA0uiEOPPIpWyJSndMiFn7ntsZXPH", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@831too/works/171", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/453571be/uploads/origins/761e2b92-3607-43e2-b4da-aab6e9479667?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=4194c4b84083e1740cb76bd691042d97", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/453571be/uploads/origins/761e2b92-3607-43e2-b4da-aab6e9479667?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=4194c4b84083e1740cb76bd691042d97, https://si.imgix.net/453571be/uploads/origins/761e2b92-3607-43e2-b4da-aab6e9479667?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=d2da7adc0bb8b2b7d1ca463deff55512 2x, https://si.imgix.net/453571be/uploads/origins/761e2b92-3607-43e2-b4da-aab6e9479667?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=2265badf678c975a48f09b8dd29b2844 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "初めまして。海外から送ります。\nTRPGシナリオ「VOID」のPC2人のイラストをお願いします。\n（シナリオのネタバレなし）\n\nお互いに信頼していますが、不安がある雰囲気なら幸いです。\n\nご検討よろしくお願いいたします。\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1-F9JKr4L0vKwRpMC0XyabBl0eMxfQ4Px?usp=sharing", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}]}